ng the `run_differs.py` diff-phase `refresh_scoped_snapshot(ctx)` call with a no-op survives the offline `tests/unit/rebar_reconciler` suite. The overlay behavior has coverage; its wiring into the diff phase does not.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] An offline regression test fails if `run_differs.py` stops invoking `refresh_scoped_snapshot(ctx)` during the diff phase.\n- [ ] The test uses existing offline fixtures/fakes and does not require the live Jira DC lane.\n- [ ] The targeted offline reconciler tests pass with the real `refresh_scoped_snapshot` wiring intact.\n","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"d9a2-7bc1-9ceb-4c37","ticket_type":"task","title":"Add offline diff-phase coverage for refresh_scoped_snapshot wiring","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["1721b78b-2b06-4846-ab10-6c3639df2804","68478213-0e1b-4e6f-a111-b35800b16608"]},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1788291270937546735,"uuid":"3f05095c-aa6b-4ff2-98e7-e210fe5ccd73"}